  "description": "If you’re out exploring the trails, this is the carbon XC bike of your dreams. Our all new Yowie Carbon keeps things comfortable for long rides on our Level Link suspension platform and the RockShox Pike Select and RockShox SIDLux Select+ rear shock providing supple suspension travel (130/110mm, front and rear). Plenty of gearing to tackle steep climbs, thanks to SRAM SX Eagle 11-50T, single-ring drivetrain. SRAM GUIDE T hydraulic disc brakes, 29×2.4″ Maxxis Rekon tires in the front and 2.25\" in the rear, and a KS EXA dropper post ensure you’ll have the tools you need to keep the adventure going. Meet the newest member of the Level Link family with this lightweight short travel 29’er.",
